    distanceKm: 85,
    titleEn: "Private Transfer from Málaga Airport to Estepona",
    titleEs: "Traslado Privado desde el Aeropuerto de Málaga a Estepona",
    seoTitleEn: "Málaga Airport to Estepona | Private Transfer – Fixed Price",
    seoTitleEs: "Aeropuerto de Málaga a Estepona | Traslado Privado",
    metaDescriptionEn: "Private chauffeur transfer from Málaga Airport to Estepona in around 50 minutes. Fixed price, flight tracking, direct door-to-door service along the coast.",
