    seoTitleEn: "Alicante to Málaga Private Transfer | 3-Hour Drive",
    seoTitleEs: "Traslado Privado Alicante a Málaga | 3 Horas – Precio Fijo",
    metaDescriptionEn: "Private chauffeur transfer from Alicante to Málaga, a 3-hour, 300 km drive across the southeastern coast. Fixed prices, door-to-door, ideal after Costa Blanca.",
